From: Krzysztof Helt <krzysztof.h1@wp.pl>

The cs46xx uses unlicensed binary blob in the cs46xx_image.h file.
Convert this file to binary firmware and use kernel firmare loader.

The DSP binary contains 3 parts which are loaded at offsets 0x0,
0x10000 and 0x20000. I have converted this image into 3 binary
images cs46xx_0.fw, cs46xx_1.fw and cs46xx_2.fw.

This issue was reported as the Linux kernel bug #10750.

Signed-off-by: Krzysztof Helt <krzysztof.h1@wp.pl>
---

I don't know who else should be informed about this patch.

 firmware/Makefile                |    2 +
 firmware/WHENCE                  |   13 +
 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_0.fw.ihex |  769 +++++++++
 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_1.fw.ihex |  897 ++++++++++
 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_2.fw.ihex | 1793 ++++++++++++++++++++
 include/sound/cs46xx.h           |    2 +-
 sound/pci/Kconfig                |    1 +
 sound/pci/cs46xx/cs46xx.c        |    9 +-
 sound/pci/cs46xx/cs46xx_image.h  | 3468 --------------------------------------
 sound/pci/cs46xx/cs46xx_lib.c    |   60 +-
 sound/pci/cs46xx/cs46xx_lib.h    |    4 -
 11 files changed, 3525 insertions(+), 3493 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_0.fw.ihex
 create mode 100644 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_1.fw.ihex
 create mode 100644 firmware/cs46xx/cs46xx_2.fw.ihex
 delete mode 100644 sound/pci/cs46xx/cs46xx_image.h

diff --git a/firmware/Makefile b/firmware/Makefile
index 243409f..b49c61f 100644
--- a/firmware/Makefile
+++ b/firmware/Makefile
@@ -84,6 +84,8 @@ fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SCSI_QLOGIC_1280) += qlogic/1040.bin qlogic/1280.bin \
 					 qlogic/12160.bin
 fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SCSI_QLOGICPTI) += qlogic/isp1000.bin
 fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SMCTR) += tr_smctr.bin
+fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SND_CS46XX) += cs46xx/cs46xx_0.fw cs46xx/cs46xx_1.fw \
+				   cs46xx/cs46xx_2.fw
 fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SND_KORG1212) += korg/k1212.dsp
 fw-shipped-$(CONFIG_SND_MAESTRO3) += ess/maestro3_assp_kernel.fw \
 				     ess/maestro3_assp_minisrc.fw
diff --git a/firmware/WHENCE b/firmware/WHENCE
index e8e550f..e904fe9 100644
--- a/firmware/WHENCE
+++ b/firmware/WHENCE
@@ -26,6 +26,19 @@ Licence: Allegedly GPLv2+, but no source visible. Marked:
 
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
+Driver: cs46xx -- Cirrus Logic (Sound Fusion) CS46xx audio device
+
+File: cs46xx/cs46xx_0.fw
+File: cs46xx/cs46xx_1.fw
+File: cs46xx/cs46xx_2.fw
+
+Licence: Unknown
+
+This is the content of the cs46xx_image.h file which contained
+a DSP code without any license.
+
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
 Driver: korg1212 -- Korg 1212 IO audio device
 
 File: korg/k1212.dsp
